        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 147  57 Inch CTC Stainless Steel Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 57\" Center to Center (CTC)  stainless steel commercial door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid round bar stock and has an overall length of 58\". The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-147-2_size.pdf?v=1718159560\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 22 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 147  57\" CTC Commercial Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 57\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 58\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Satin Stainless Steel finish</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n\r\n<li>Packaged with Thru Bolt Mounting Hardware for 1-3/4\" door</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<I>***<b>This item is discontinued, only one remaining in stock.</b></i>\r\n</p>",
